%% Finance — operational invoicing & payments (Phase 9, ADR 0038)
flowchart TD
    C[Customer / Project / Quotation] --> INV[Invoice · DRAFT]
    INV -->|edit lines / dates| INV
    INV -->|issue · freezes snapshot| ISS[Invoice · ISSUED]
    ISS -->|due_date < today ∧ outstanding > 0| OD{{overdue = true<br/>derived, not a status}}

    PAY[Payment · RECORDED] -->|may stay fully unallocated| PAY
    PAY -->|allocate · FOR UPDATE payment→invoice| ALLOC[(payment_allocations · active)]
    ALLOC --> RECALC[recalcInvoice / recalcPayment<br/>lock + recompute projection]
    RECALC --> ISS
    ISS -->|0 < outstanding < total| PP[Invoice · PARTIALLY_PAID]
    PP -->|outstanding = 0| PD[Invoice · PAID]
    PP -.->|more payment| PD

    CN[Credit note · DRAFT] -->|issue · amount ≤ outstanding| CNI[(credit_notes · ISSUED)]
    CNI --> RECALC

    PAY -->|reverse · FOR UPDATE + RECORDED guard| REV[Payment · REVERSED]
    REV -->|stamp reversed_at on payment + allocations| RECALC

    subgraph GUARDS [invariants]
      G1[unique tenant+payment+invoice]
      G2[CHECK amount_paid + amount_credited ≤ grand_total]
      G3[CHECK allocated_amount ≤ amount]
      G4[Idempotency-Key → finance_idempotency]
      G5[finance_counters atomic value = value + 1]
    end

    ISS --> OUT[(outbox_events)]
    PP --> OUT
    PD --> OUT
    REV --> OUT
    CNI --> OUT
    OD --> OUT
    OUT --> N[Phase 8 Notification Engine<br/>invoice issued / payment receipt / overdue]

    ISS --> SUM[Customer + Project financial summary<br/>read-only, computed live]
